This repository contains patches against other projects. Each patch carries the license of the code it changes.

packaging/owl-airdrop.patch
    Changes to OWL (Open Wireless Link), https://github.com/seemoo-lab/owl
    Copyright of OWL: its authors (SEEMOO Lab, TU Darmstadt). GPL-3.0.

driver/mt7921-awdl.diff
    Changes to the Linux kernel's mt76 driver (drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7921).
    GPL-2.0, as the kernel. The injected-rate part is derived from
    https://github.com/shaecodes-wilde/mt76 (branch fix/mt7921-family-driver).

Neither OWL nor the kernel sources are distributed here; the build scripts fetch them from upstream.

